  "stability": {
   "node": "ref25: R31.2, U5.1, R32.1, R34.1, R36.1 (frozen default.net)",
   "verdict": "stable: TI states stability with any capacitive load (SNOS455H p.1), internal compensation with no output capacitor (7.3 p.14) and stability with a bypass capacitor (8.1 p.15). The frozen netlist puts no capacitor on REF25 at all (R31, U5.1, R32, R34, R36 only); the three filter caps sit behind >= 10 k (C30 100 pF via R32, C31 1 nF via R34 12.6 k, C33 1 nF via R36 10 k), so the cathode sees at most pad / trace parasitics directly. Load-capacitance range at the node: ~0 pF direct, 2.1 nF total behind 10-12.6 k. Oscillation is not a credible mode; it is carried inside TI's 20 % 'dynamic impedance' mode (U3)."
